          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[김수영의 문학과 초현실주의]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[The Literature of Kim Soo-young and Surrealism]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[The Literature of Kim Soo-young and Surrealism]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
